Topic 09 – Strings
Objective: String manipulation, character operations, comparisons and logical problem-solving.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	String Reversal	Reverse a string without using StringBuilder.reverse().
02	String Palindrome	Check whether a string is a palindrome. Example: madam.
03	Count Vowels and Consonants	Count the vowels and consonants in a string.
04	Character Frequency	Count how many times a particular character occurs in a string.
05	Character Frequency for All	Find the frequency of each character in a string.
06	Remove Spaces	Remove all spaces from a string.
07	Duplicate Characters	Find duplicate characters in a string.
08	Anagram Check	Check whether two strings are anagrams. Example: listen and silent.
09	Word Count	Count the number of words in a sentence.
10	First Non-Repeated Character	Find the first character that occurs only once in a string.